16
00:01:37,139 --> 00:01:38,260
You shall be safe

17
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:39,542
The pain

18
00:01:39,582 --> 00:01:41,544
is hard to gain

19
00:01:41,585 --> 00:01:45,511
